    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Import · T-050 · Cuentas - Domingo v2 · n8n 2.41.6\n1. Import inactive. Keep the Recordatorio /exec URL; review Apps Script VehicleLedger Custom Auth and Telegram VehicleLedger (Enviar aviso retains the Apps Script chatId).\n2. Reuse the SAME Data Tables as cuentas-whatsapp-entrada-v1:\n- wa_ultimo: remitente (string), fecha (ISO UTC string).\n- wa_pendientes: destino (string), texto (string), origen (string).\nDo not create id, createdAt, or updatedAt; they are automatic.\n3. Replace CONFIGURE_WA_DIEGO in Config WA Domingo with Diego's authorized number, DIGITS ONLY, matching m.from in the inbound Config WA. An unchanged placeholder leaves the notification queued for a recipient that never writes.\n4. Replace CONFIGURE_WA_ULTIMO_TABLE_ID in Leer última hora and CONFIGURE_WA_PENDIENTES_TABLE_ID in Borrar espera anterior, Limpiar espera vieja, and Dejar en espera.\n5. Replace CONFIGURE_ENVIAR_WORKFLOW_ID with cuentas-enviar-v1; review {canal,destino,texto,botones}, mode each, and wait. The subworkflow converts HTML; no Meta templates are used.\n6. Settings: CONFIGURE_ERRORES_WORKFLOW_ID = cuentas-errores-v1; America/Bogota; callerPolicy workflowsFromSameOwner.\n7. Publish cuentas-enviar-v1 and cuentas-whatsapp-entrada-v1 BEFORE Domingo v2, after satisfying their dependencies.\n8. UNPUBLISH cuentas-domingo-v1 BEFORE publishing cuentas-domingo-v2. Keep only one weekly schedule active. Sunday 09:00 Bogotá.\n9. Manual tests: last inbound 2 h ago → send; 30 h / missing / invalid / future → queue. Two closed-window Sundays retain only Diego's latest origen domingo pending item. Technical error, ok:false, or missing ok → clear previous Sunday and queue; ok:true clears older Sunday items using Limpiar espera vieja without inserting.\n10. Empty reads/deletes continue. Multiple deleted rows still cause one insertion. Duplicate wa_ultimo rows: first by id ASC. Do not manually execute two Sundays concurrently: delete + insert is not atomic.\nConfigured window: 23 h; valid UTC timestamps that are not in the future. Preserve HTML from Armar aviso. An ignorar response ends before WhatsApp. Group Telegram and health behavior is preserved.\nDelivered inactive without pinned data or secrets. Offline checks do not replace live n8n/Data Tables/Telegram/WhatsApp tests.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 1100
      },
